---
import { BASE as base } from '../base';
---
<h2 class="mt5 f4">
    <a class="link b black" href={`${base}training-courses/8hr-pre-assignment-training`}>8 Hour Pre-Assignment Training</a>
</h2>
<p class="lh-copy">
    A general introductory course. You must complete this course and submit a copy of the certificate issued to you with your security guard application.
</p>
<a class="db mt2 b black" href={`${base}training-courses/8hr-pre-assignment-training`}>Learn More</a>
<h2 class="mt5 f4">
    <a class="link b black" href={`${base}training-courses/16hr-on-the-job-training`}>16 Hour On-The-Job Training (OJT)</a>
</h2>
<p class="lh-copy">
    A course relevant to the duties of guards, requirements of the work site, and the needs of the employer. You must complete this training within 90 days of employment as a security guard.
</p>
<a class="db mt2 b black" href={`${base}training-courses/16hr-on-the-job-training`}>Learn More</a>
<h2 class="mt5 f4">
    <a class="link b black" href={`${base}training-courses/8hr-annual-in-service-training`}>8 Hour Annual In-Service Training</a>
</h2>
<p class="lh-copy">
    This course must be completed each calendar year you hold a security guard registration. Your registration is issued for two years, therefore, you must complete two 8 Hour Annual In-Service training courses within your registration effective and expiration dates to be eligible for renewal.
</p>
<a class="db mt2 b black" href={`${base}training-courses/8hr-annual-in-service-training`}>Learn More</a>
